      "message": "feat(build): a headless binary per crate\n\ngeometry, cl, tools, sim and motion each ship a small CLI in\nsrc/bin/<package>.rs, shaped like post (USAGE, --help, --version,\nbad input -> message + exit 1, no panic):\n\n- camcraft-geometry: STL (binary/ASCII) -> triangles, bounds, open edges\n- camcraft-cl: CL dump -> move stats, lengths, bounds, chaining\n- camcraft-tools: list the catalog; speeds/feeds from the cutting table\n- camcraft-sim: dexel cut of a stock box, removed volume, rapid/depth\n  verdict (exit 2 when flagged)\n- camcraft-motion: facing over a rectangle, written as a CL dump\n\ncl gains cl::text, the golden CL dump reader/writer (byte-identical to\nthe app's golden writer; every golden round-trips). Each crate carries\ntests/headless_bin.rs (happy path + bad input). Not packaged in the\nrelease zip - see docs/decisions/32-headless-bins.md.\n\nFixes #32\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
